{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 39,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        126.61820220947266,
        27.289522171020508,
        326.90234375,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "5. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE NEWBORN CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1028747558594,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "at 1–4 months age and on exclusive breastfeeding at 4–6 months after birth. It also",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.0829162597656,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "noted that although there is low quality evidence, the cost of its implementation is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        355.36285400390625,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "low and is most likely to be feasible to implement in low-resource settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        110.26070404052734,
        231.48292541503906,
        122.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "5.3.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.91542053222656,
        399.0827941894531,
        139.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "There was very low quality evidence from one Cochrane review published in 2007,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.91542053222656,
        399.082763671875,
        152.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "although the studied population and intervention evaluated was generally in line",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.0928955078125,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "with the intervention of interest. The exception was skin-to-skin contact was started",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        399.1628723144531,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "after the first hour of birth in some of the studies included in the recommendation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.91539001464844,
        399.11273193359375,
        191.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Hence, the results should be interpreted with caution. Notably, there were important",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.91539001464844,
        399.13299560546875,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "variations in the implementation of the intervention of interest. In many studies, the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.91539001464844,
        399.11279296875,
        217.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "intervention was not initiated immediately after birth and its duration ranged from a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.91539001464844,
        399.122802734375,
        230.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "few minutes to several hours in different trials. This is a common practice and being",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.91539001464844,
        399.0829162597656,
        243.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "implemented currently according to WHO guidelines. Since there was no notable",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.91539001464844,
        399.13275146484375,
        256.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "harm in implementing this recommendation, the expected benefits outweighed the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.91539001464844,
        80.64289855957031,
        269.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "risks.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        219.79139709472656,
        268.69537353515625,
        313.1014099121094,
        282.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.3",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        268.9153747558594,
        396.8504943847656,
        282.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "There was very low quality evidence ( ) in making this rec­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.9153747558594,
        399.0928039550781,
        295.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "ommendation. None of the studies included in the review examined the impact of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.9153747558594,
        399.1128234863281,
        308.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "early SSC on neonatal mortality. Ten studies involving 552 participants have showed",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.9153747558594,
        399.1727294921875,
        321.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "significant positive effects of early SSC on breastfeeding at 1–4 months post birth",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.9153747558594,
        399.1128234863281,
        334.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "(OR=1.8, 95% CI 1.08 to 3.07). Only one available trial with 92 participants assessed",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.9153747558594,
        399.1728515625,
        347.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "the effect of SSC on exclusive breastfeeding at 4–6 months post birth. Results were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.9153747558594,
        396.8504943847656,
        360.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "positive and statistically significant (OR=5.67, 95% CI 2.27 to 14.16). The pooled ef­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.9153747558594,
        399.0528564453125,
        373.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "fect on mean duration of breastfeeding from seven trials (324 participants) was not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.9153747558594,
        399.1027526855469,
        386.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "statistically significant (weighted mean difference [WMD] = 42.55 days, 95% CI -1.69",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.9153747558594,
        95.962890625,
        399.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "to 86.79).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        398.9153747558594,
        396.8504943847656,
        412.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Three studies, with 168 participants, measured the effect of SSC on body tem­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.9153747558594,
        399.0528259277344,
        425.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "perature in the second hour of life. Two of them measured the temperature after",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        424.9154052734375,
        399.0528259277344,
        438.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "90 minutes of SSC and the third after 2 hours of SSC. All three studies started the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.9154052734375,
        396.8504943847656,
        451.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "intervention immediately after birth. The first two studies observed a positive, statis­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        450.9154052734375,
        399.1129150390625,
        464.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "tically significant effect while the third failed to demonstrate a significant difference",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        463.9154052734375,
        399.1029052734375,
        477.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "in temperature between groups. Meta-analysis of these three studies showed a pooled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        476.9154052734375,
        280.07281494140625,
        490.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "WMD of 0.25 degrees centigrade, 95% CI -0.15 to 0.65.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        489.9154052734375,
        399.04150390625,
        503.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "Although there were a few studies from developing country settings, the majority",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        502.9154052734375,
        399.1028747558594,
        516.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "were conducted in hospitals from high-income countries. No adverse effects were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        515.9154052734375,
        87.84290313720703,
        529.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "shown.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        540.4338989257812,
        163.95286560058594,
        552.4239501953125
      ],
      "text": "5.3.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        556.0785522460938,
        88.77290344238281,
        568.2185668945312
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        569.0885620117188,
        399.0629577636719,
        582.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "SSC has a positive effect on breastfeeding 1–4 months post birth and on exclusivity of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        582.0885620117188,
        399.0428466796875,
        595.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "breastfeeding at 4–6 months after birth (low quality evidence for both). As exclusive",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        595.0885620117188,
        399.0727233886719,
        608.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "breastfeeding is associated with improved survival, SSC may be expected to reduce",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        608.0885620117188,
        136.45289611816406,
        621.5785522460938
      ],
      "text": "neonatal mortality.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.41819763183594,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.62620544433594,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "25",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}